<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPAIN BEAT YUGOSLAVIA 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPAIN BEAT YUGOSLAVIA 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>VALENCIA, Spain 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain beat Yugoslavia 2-0</p>
<p>(halftime 2-0) in their World Cup European group six qualifying</p>
<p>match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Josep Guardiola pen 19, Raul Gonzalez 38.</p>
